{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your style. Do you prefer speed? Or maybe control? Or more damage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/1_-_Estilo_de_juego.gif?t=1741566463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your strategy with satellite pedestals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2_-_Pedestales.gif?t=1741566463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After each wave you will visit the shop, where you can buy, sell, upgrade and copy your crests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/Tienda.gif?t=1741566463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By defeating enemies, you will gain essence that you can use for various purposes, such as acquiring improvements in the skill tree, new crests and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/\u00c1rbol_y_Sintetizador.gif?t=1741566463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You embody Union, a small being with no memories, in its adventure within the world of Anima, along with various characters with particular situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/Animaciones.gif?t=1741566463\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meeting Guide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/5ba9881b0e57553872fb6f7b465aac79e959f91a.jpg"},{"name":"Genuine Concern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/2b5286e